previously I had stipulated that damage that was happening out of your sight didn't get float text,&#x20;

I launched into hard mode as a warlock, walked int a room, cast agony on a bunch of mobs, turned my back and could not see any of my DOTS ticking --&#x20;

can we fix this?&#x20;

concretely?
generically?

